            "line": 244,
            "text": "theorem primitive_eq_integral (P : Patch) (e : ℕ) {F : ℝ × E → ℝ} (hF : ContDiff ℝ ∞ F)\n    (hs : RadialAlias.RadiallySupported P.a P.b F) (z : ℝ × E) :\n    primitive P e F z = ∫ r in (0 : ℝ)..z.1, r ^ e * adjusted P e F (r, z.2)"
